  "title": "Royalty Pharma to Announce First Quarter 2026 Financial Results on May 6, 2026",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY, April 15, 2026 – Royalty Pharma plc (Nasdaq: RPRX) today announced that it will report its first quarter 2026 financial results on Wednesday, May 6, 2026 before the U.S. financial markets open. The company will host a conference call and simultaneous webcast at 8:00 a.m. Eastern Time that day.",
